{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is for adults only.</strong><br>It contains nudity, sex, and pornographic content in a story-driven Ren'Py format.<br>The game is entirely fictional, and all characters are portrayed as being over 18 years of age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meryem\u2019s life is dull, blurry, and constantly under the pressure of her controlling husband, Ali.</strong><br>When Ali gets a new job opportunity, they are forced to move to a new city and a new house.<br>Meryem is relieved to finally be away from Ali's family, but at the same time, she struggles to adapt to this new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>click-to-continue</strong>, <strong>story-focused visual novel</strong>.<br>You will witness that a person\u2019s inner world is often different from what appears on the outside.<br>There are no fast-paced events in this game.<br>Instead, you\u2019ll experience how a new relationship truly unfolds\u2014slowly and realistically, just like in real life.<br>See Meryem\u2019s inner world.<br>If you focus on the story, you'll truly understand what Meryem is feeling.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912680?t=1756373034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912680?t=1756373034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912680/6ae14d0a65140328d756722573c4ccd2c210dde3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756373034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912680/6ae14d0a65140328d756722573c4ccd2c210dde3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756373034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is for adults only. It is a story-driven Ren'Py game that contains nudity, sex, and pornographic content. The game is entirely fictional